{"parentUuid":"eac6c932-6849-4a9a-b691-e01c5c2934ee","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_013cGbncFHgfin7UVJXU5t9j","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"04685420-2b41-46fe-8caf-45451a2eb25e","timestamp":"2026-10-21T04:32:11.588Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.305","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"04685420-2b41-46fe-8caf-45451a2eb25e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEkoWRVoqSu9C9nMtiqk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm checking what preload.cjs exposes since it's always loaded in the Electron window, wondering if I could expose something there, or alternatively detect Electron via user agent and apply CORS/crossOrigin handling only on images within cards in that case.\n\nI'm also considering a more involved alternative: a custom `app://remote-image/` protocol handler where main fetches remote URLs and serves them as same-origin, satisfying CSP img-src 'self' without crossorigin attributes -- but that opens an SSRF-ish surface since the renderer could ask main to fetch arbitrary URLs, so I'd need to restrict to https and image content types. That feels like more machinery and security risk than I want.\n\nI'm leaning toward the smaller approach instead: have main add `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *` to https image responses, and have cards set `crossOrigin=\"anonymous\"` only when running inside the Electron shell, which means I need a reliable way to detect that context synchronously in both full and preview modes -- checking preload.cjs for that.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3829,"cache_read_input_tokens":60330,"output_tokens":710,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":548},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3829,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":710,"cache_read_input_tokens":60330,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3829,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3829},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":