{"parentUuid":"d2be35a3-f684-423a-8c31-21279e2aac4d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01DK78Guj3621cFB6M4Uqx31","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"92cb7cd9-0cf5-4936-876c-1845368986da","timestamp":"2026-10-21T04:38:03.268Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.305","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"92cb7cd9-0cf5-4936-876c-1845368986da","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEmDwpdnCXwH44uFruYW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm figuring out the right parent reference for positioning — using the frame's parentElement to anchor the pill correctly within the item stage. Now I'm adding a ref for the pill element in ZoomableImage...\n\nWriting lens refraction logic...\n\nStill writing positioning logic...\n\nWith no dependency array, this effect runs after every render, which covers pan, zoom, and frame changes since the stage's content box drives the frame. I'm now considering whether the flight animation's opacity and inset transitions trigger repeated frame resizes, which would mean this effect fires on every animation frame alongside a MutationObserver.\n\nSince the pill's DOM subtree includes the portal content, the MutationObserver should pick up style changes and trigger a cheap resync reading the pill's computed style and rect. Paint events likely still fire for the canvas even while the pill is at opacity 0, but that just means a tiny extra draw each frame, which seems negligible.\n\nI also need to make sure the lens pill keeps its drop shadow despite the `.glass[data-liquid]` rule removing box-shadow — I need a more specific selector targeting `.item-zoom-pill.glass[data-liquid]` to reapply the shadow, since it has higher specificity than the base rule.\n\nThinking through the LiquidGlass target setup for the lens, I'm confirming the pill itself is the `.glass` target with no nested glass children, and working out the shape geometry: the canvas sits inside an absolutely-positioned wrapper matching the pill's padding box, so the border box extends 1px beyond the canvas on each side, with the radius capped at half the height for the pill shape. That gives a glass bezel just outside the canvas edges, which should look fine visually.\n\nWriting wrapper styles...\n\nI'm also checking whether `box-sizing: border-box` is applied globally, since that affects whether the stage rect dimensions line up correctly with the lens stage sizing, and noting that the pill's own positioning creates a stacking context so the negative z-index child still paints above the pill's background.\n\nI'm weighing whether to introduce a custom property for the stage surface versus inheriting background through the DOM chain, and considering how the overlay's \"flying\" state resets border-radius and border-color on the stage while the pill itself gets hidden.\n\nI also want to check crossOrigin handling for the lens image when the source is remote, versus the main stage image which doesn't need it since it's not drawn to canvas — and note that when zoomed, the stage shows the original image while the lens still displays the thumbnail.\n\nI need to add the import for the canvas crossOrigin helper and LiquidGlass component into ExpandedItemOverlay, then move on to writing the actual code.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":710,"cache_read_input_tokens":108983,"output_tokens":3218,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":3040},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":710,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3218,"cache_read_input_tokens":108983,"cache_creation_input_tokens":710,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":710},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":30690,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgEmDwVYMnqo5b2ignCg4","requestRef":"113d26bb-d121-427f-855f-af14bb7c4959","requested