{"parentUuid":"48f76c9d-305c-4cc5-861c-c603cb6f8bda","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEmYDq3nLthx6a6Tn2iw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm seeing that the CSS mode still reports liquid targets present, so my deletion of the canvas prototype property apparently didn't take effect as intended, and the A/B comparison isn't actually isolating the two modes like I expected.\n\nMaybe `layoutSubtree` isn't defined directly on HTMLCanvasElement.prototype but inherited further up, so deleting it there does nothing. I'll instead override `navigator.gpu` to return undefined and treat that as the fallback check, since the run-to-run timing differences look like noise around the 75Hz refresh rate anyway. Let me fix the injection and re-run.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":828,"cache_read_input_tokens":136099,"output_tokens":715,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":369},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":828,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":715,"cache_read_input_tokens":136099,"cache_creation_input_tokens":828,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":828},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":5819,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgEmYDVDHsHR8EAZ22E7H","requestRef":"89676768-36ae-41a6-9d41-a4e2454781d1","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"acbb5958-e098-4383-921e-5f861defcfbb","timestamp":"2026-10-21T04:41:46.297Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort