{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","id":"35e0c882-eba0-4e34-ba25-fed532a73b85","timestamp":"2026-10-21T04:54:28.824Z","version":"2.1.305","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"a9ed8921dc21a185c51f032ab201ef86db193f2b4a3c27f0d2631dc37b2aa860","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"summarized"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"xhigh"}},"base":"71942e08-8743-404f-a0c0-8c0b22969099","keep":251,"tail":["9b6c7eeb049946017935da31eaf7dc39a26ec6404f42df6933418fac1356ffc4","623decdb1b868f9ec921efb1571b7d502e879ed9c60b8353f1ec2b7989eaa8c7","f3d3d384d4e9a4efdc2f6dc6be69ac05597b9c41f4bd87ca98db22b5f678d2c5"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",253,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"8e0ce9132d5a53c22f29abd03a22da2b085d7bf58e23382510ab2108bf7aa9a3"}
{"parentUuid":"046e8589-ccca-4798-9fe6-24abff4982d4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEnWue1jFDsG4BfZZGqE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The preview seed cards are using full-size images rather than thumbnails, which matches the expensive-rendering issue flagged earlier. I want to check how large the desktop app's generated thumbnails actually are, since if they're much smaller than the raw images, the real app's per-frame cost should be far lower than what the preview is simulating.\n\nI'm thinking through how to validate this without a full build: I could try swapping the seed images for downscaled versions directly in the running preview via CDP, drawing them into a canvas and replacing the image src with the smaller blob, then rerunning the slide test. The tricky part is whether virtuoso's re-renders would reset those swapped attributes during scrolling.\n\nRather than fight that, I consider intercepting the network layer with CDP's Fetch domain to serve downscaled JPEGs for the seed-demo image URLs, generating them on the fly via canvas resizing — elaborate but workable. Still, I wonder if it's even necessary, since the earlier note already confirmed 560px thumbnails caused zero hitches, meaning the heavy seed images are really just a preview-only artifact rather than a real issue.\n\nBut I realize the real app also pulls in remote images like og:image previews and YouTube posters at much larger native sizes, which aren't pre-thumbnailed locally, so downsampling those per-frame could matter more. To get a credible number, I think it's worth running the Fetch-interception experiment: enabling CDP's Fetch domain and, in-page, resizing fetched images via createImageBitmap and OffscreenCanvas before returning them.\n\nI'll scope the Fetch interception to only image resource types matching the seed-demo pattern, since a page-level fetch() call wouldn't be caught by that filter anyway. The plan is to pre-generate base64 thumbnails for all the seed-demo jpgs before reload, then enable Fetch interception, reload, and fulfill requests with those thumbnails, then measure both modes — it's a bit of extra scripting work, but the resulting comparison would be worth it.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2543,"cache_read_input_tokens":201511,"output_tokens":1723,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1524},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2543,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1723,"cache_read_input_tokens":201511,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2543,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2543},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":19440,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgEnWuJg7UEwcaA7dS53g","requestRef":"35e0c882-eba0-4e34-ba25-fed532a73b85","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"944b4ef1-5572-436c-a6c2-bf3804e0d942","timestamp":"2026-10-21T04:54:49.048Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.305","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"944b4ef1-5572-436c-a6c2-bf3804e0d942","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEnWue1jFDsG4BfZZGqE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The preview seed is loading full-size 6000×4000 photos into 332px cards — exactly what the Paper note warned about, since the real app uses generated thumbnails instead. I'll check the thumbnail size so I can test with realistic images.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2543,"cache_read_input_tokens":201511,"output_tokens":1723,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1524},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2543,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1723,"cache_read_input_tokens":201511,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2543,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2543},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":13,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgEnWuJg7UEwcaA7dS53g","requestRef":"35e0c882-eba0-4e34-ba25-fed532a73b85","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"801db65d-13e2-4635-9c01-e3bf39f160d0","timestamp":"2026-10-21T04:54:49.080Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.305","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
