{"parentUuid":"69cff017-f780-4254-84da-80f10007a983","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a5d551ad-5e9e-431c-a603-b554797c9ccd","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016a2Cz6kcD79y3DqTznQHVc","type":"tool_result","content":"3:## Status\n7:## Decision summary\n11:## Application stack\n26:## Article extraction\n32:### Integration approach\n44:## OCR\n50:## Local AI architecture\n65:### Runtime choices\n81:## AI behavior rules\n92:## Model selection policy\n102:## Data, backup, and security\n108:## Update checks\n112:## First technical milestone\n39:6. Preserve supported video embeds through an allowlist.\n106:Treat all fetched HTML as untrusted. Sanitize article HTML before rendering, allowlist iframe providers, strip scripts/event handlers/unsafe URLs/untrusted `srcdoc`, keep remote content isolated from Electron's privileged main process, and do not expose arbitrary filesystem or shell commands through the preload bridge.\n3:### Added\n45:### Fixed\n52:### Changed\n85:### Removed\n92:### Fixed\n131:### Added\n143:### Added\n154:### Fixed\n167:### Added\n173:### Fixed\n184:### Added\n190:### Fixed\n199:### Added\n211:### Added","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"1c078db2-736f-4e7c-9bcf-93f3cb11b8d9","timestamp":"2026-10-21T04:59:36.624Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"3:## Status\n7:## Decision summary\n11:## Application stack\n26:## Article extraction\n32:### Integration approach\n44:## OCR\n50:## Local AI architecture\n65:### Runtime choices\n81:## AI behavior rules\n92:## Model selection policy\n102:## Data, backup, and security\n108:## Update checks\n112:## First technical milestone\n39:6. Preserve supported video embeds through an allowlist.\n106:Treat all fetched HTML as untrusted. Sanitize article HTML before rendering, allowlist iframe providers, strip scripts/event handlers/unsafe URLs/untrusted `srcdoc`, keep remote content isolated from Electron's privileged main process, and do not expose arbitrary filesystem or shell commands through the preload bridge.\n3:### Added\n45:### Fixed\n52:### Changed\n85:### Removed\n92:### Fixed\n131:### Added\n143:### Added\n154:### Fixed\n167:### Added\n173:### Fixed\n184:### Added\n190:### Fixed\n199:### Added\n211:### Added","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"69cff017-f780-4254-84da-80f10007a983","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.305","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
