{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","hash":"956d483f10cf5eb5079d1f40ade3e3eb31a24e9de667611cb3bc7fb01edf8dfa","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I should add a changelog entry noting that toolbar controls, the search chip, the collapsed sidebar tab, and the image zoom control render as liquid glass using WebGPU refraction, with a fallback to CSS glass when WebGPU or Chromium's HTML-in-Canvas isn't available. I'll also note under Changed that remote card images now load with CORS, since the desktop app adds the necessary header.\n\nI'm also considering whether this CORS change deserves documentation in tech-stack.md, since it crosses the main/renderer boundary per AGENTS.md guidance -- I should check if there's an existing section discussing Electron security or CSP where this would fit.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016a2Cz6kcD79y3DqTznQHVc","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/t3-47ff5304 && grep -n \"^## \\|^### \" docs/tech-stack.md | head -40; grep -n -i \"csp\\|content-security\\|untrusted\\|allowlist\" docs/tech-stack.md | head; awk '/^## Unreleased/,/^## [0-9]/' docs/changelog.md | grep -n \"^### \"","description":"Outline tech-stack and changelog sections"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
