{"parentUuid":"09c4105a-0e59-4667-90fc-e81b11f22d8d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_013yeyuBHWwsaV942eEzot28","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"09a17a71-5956-4860-8d18-dd2938b9f2ba","timestamp":"2026-10-21T05:04:25.814Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.305","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"09a17a71-5956-4860-8d18-dd2938b9f2ba","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEoGdUdpmsstXEprgYbZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I pushed the liquid glass work to #170 as commit `776b00b`.\n\nFor #174 (perf/library-io), the only open item is that it's stacked on #170 but was branched before the recent work. It's now missing three commits from #170:\n- `e09816e`: QA fixes for the item view, Serendipity, empty Spaces and the sidebar.\n- `dc579b9`: smooth zoom, the Space picker, the archive fade and the wordmark.\n- `776b00b`: liquid glass, pushed just now.\n\nWithout them, #174 still shows that older code. Its diff against #170 will also look noisy and could conflict when #170 merges. The fix is to merge #170 into #174, or rebase #174 onto it, and push. I haven't touched #174; want me to do that?\n\nThe other two open questions are separate from #174:\n1. Should Settings open on the General tab by default?\n2. In an empty smart Space where nobody has searched, should \"Clear search\" and \"Try another word\" be hidden?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":593,"cache_read_input_tokens":250818,"output_tokens":324,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":593,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":324,"cache_read_input_tokens":250818,"cache_creation_input_tokens":593,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":593},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgEoGdCXZCmwunbUuneeu","requestRef":"e67aa8a2-0130-46f5-82de-ef