{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","hash":"714aa63e37f5e1ba20d772f69c6a6c451e4e1415d6f0a6f58e099eeb541d8d1a","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No regression with 0 slow frames and realistic thumbnails, so I'll clean up by killing electron and restoring the registry. I'll skip the full project-wide typecheck since the only change is a trivial exported prop type, and biome on the changed files is already done.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"With realistic thumbnails, scrolling has no slow frames, so the earlier ones came from decoding full-size sample images, not from the blur. Cleaning up."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015xPRsazASeJG76JynK5Np1","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/t3-47ff5304 && S=$(cat /tmp/ink-scratch); kill $(cat $S/pid); W=$(cygpath -w $S); for i in 1 2 3 4 5; do curl -s -m 1 http://127.0.0.1:$(cat $S/port)/json >/dev/null || break; sleep 1; done; curl -s -m 1 http://127.0.0.1:$(cat $S/port)/json >/dev/null && echo still-up || echo port-closed; MSYS2_ARG_CONV_EXCL='*' reg import \"$W\\\\reg.reg\"; timeout 60 bunx biome check src/App.css src/components/LibraryEdgeFade.tsx 2>&1 | tail -1; git status --short","description":"Stop Electron, restore registry, lint, show changes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
