{"parentUuid":"367e774f-9bd7-46be-a653-57e191f0af9e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFP3eUm4HWGkqWnVG4kP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I should note that the paper file doesn't actually have a progressive blur design, so I interpreted \"like in paper\" as referring to the blue-line extents instead. I also want to flag the pinned-query change, which is still uncommitted and waiting.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":623,"cache_read_input_tokens":131575,"output_tokens":701,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":57},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":623,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":701,"cache_read_input_tokens":131575,"cache_creation_input_tokens":623,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":623},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":6647,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFP3e5TYwtp2FGciBivc","requestRef":"83a7c34e-8af0-450c-b2e1-59a5958d38a8","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7657b4e9-b58e-4c30-b263-afa6d846f885","timestamp":"2026-10-21T12:27:24.948Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"7657b4e9-b58e-4c30-b263-afa6d846f885","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFP3eUm4HWGkqWnVG4kP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The library now scrolls up to your blue lines, and both edges fade out through the React Bits progressive blur. There's no dark tint any more; I removed the dark gradient overlay that used to sit under the bottom blur.\n\n**Scrolled**, with cards blurring under the toolbar and at the bottom:\n![Scrolled](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\sidebar-overlap\\2-scrolled.png)\n\n**At rest:**\n![At rest](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\sidebar-overlap\\1-rest.png)\n\n**End of the list**, where the last row stops clear of the bottom blur:\n![End of list](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\sidebar-overlap\\3-end.png)\n\n- **Scroll area:** the grid now reaches 25px from the top of the window and 11px from the bottom. Cards still sit in the same place at rest, just below the toolbar.\n- **The blur:** it's the copy of React Bits' `GradualBlur` that was already in the repo, used for both edges. All its settings are at the top of `src/components/LibraryEdgeFade.tsx`: strength, layers, curve, exponential, opacity and each band's height (88px top, 72px bottom). Its other props, like `saturation`, `tint` and `autoHide`, can be added to the same object.\n- **Pinned search:** with a search pinned, cards now scroll up under the filter row too, instead of stopping hard below it.\n- **Performance:** scrolling had no slow frames in my measurement, and nothing repaints while the library is idle.\n\nI checked this in the Electron preview, and Biome passes on both files. I didn't find a progressive blur design in the Paper file, so the strength and band heights are my own starting values.\n\nThis isn't committed yet, and I'm holding off until you've sent the rest of your changes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":623,"cache_read_input_tokens":131575,"output_tokens":701,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":57},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":623,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":701,"cache_read_input_tokens":131575,"cache_creation_input_tokens":623,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":623},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgFP3e5TYwtp2FGciBivc","requestRef":"83a7c34e-8af0-450c-b2e1-59a5958d38a8","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5f32160e-2b7d-418d-b624-815db0162f8f","timestamp":"2026-10-21T12:27:24.971Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
