{"parentUuid":"ea5ed342-53dd-4b18-90ca-23d48a01f00d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01XvKZV9Xs6uRs9GMCR9SrZp","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"1933c3fe-9962-424b-bbf8-1e20193fea7a","timestamp":"2026-10-21T12:37:29.101Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"1933c3fe-9962-424b-bbf8-1e20193fea7a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFPpNP99WjrSateDAoq6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed all three and pushed them to #170 as `1dec9e7`. #174 is untouched.\n\n![Window with sidebar collapsed, scrolled](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\sidebar-overlap\\5-screen.png)\n\n- **Blur:** it's a bit weaker now (strength 2 → 1.4) and covers a taller band: 112px at the top instead of 88, and 96px at the bottom instead of 72. These numbers are at the top of `src/components/LibraryEdgeFade.tsx`.\n- **Toolbar buttons:** the search pill, Add, back/forward and the view toggle are no longer blurred. The glass behind them used to be drawn underneath the blur, so it got blurred too. The blur is now part of the backdrop the glass reflects, so the pills stay sharp and the blurred cards show through them.\n- **Window controls:** the opaque box was Windows' own title-bar overlay. I made it transparent in `electron/main.mjs`, so the cards show behind minimize, maximize and close. The native buttons are still the ones in use, so Windows 11's snap layouts menu still works.\n\nThe screenshot above is a real capture of the window, since the window controls don't appear in the app's own screenshots. Idle repaints are still 0. Scrolling had at most 1 slow frame and the sidebar slide at most 2."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":393,"cache_read_input_tokens":151772,"output_tokens":464,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":393,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":464,"cache_read_input_tokens":151772,"cache_creation_input_t