{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","hash":"4b40d924b6d288cb6a7e9feaccca01ec72d23e569c2de27c7c24a27a501ba369","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need screenshots of both versions at the same scroll position with zoomed crops of the top and bottom edges. Since the blur layers are React-rendered DOM elements rather than pure CSS, I'll have to build the app twice -- once with 5 layers, once with 8 -- take screenshots each time, then revert. I'll also fold in the performance numbers I already have before combining everything together.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"I'll build both versions and capture the same scroll position in each."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01X13x9Tds3SELfWryiDm5MS","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/t3-47ff5304 && OUT=/c/Users/chris/AppData/Local/Temp/agents/chat-images/sidebar-overlap && S=$(mktemp -d) && echo $S > /tmp/ink-scratch && W=$(cygpath -w $S) && MSYS2_ARG_CONV_EXCL='*' reg export 'HKCU\\Software\\Classes\\inkling' \"$W\\\\reg.reg\" >/dev/null && cp src/components/LibraryEdgeFade.tsx /tmp/LEF.tsx && for L in 5 8; do sed -i \"s/  layers: [0-9]*,/  layers: $L,/\" src/components/LibraryEdgeFade.tsx; timeout 180 bunx vite build --mode electron-preview >/dev/null 2>&1; if [ $L = 5 ]; then (env -u ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE ./node_modules/.bin/electron . --preview --user-data-dir=\"$W\\\\ud\" --remote-debugging-port=0 > $S/el.log 2>&1 & echo $! > $S/pid); for i in $(seq 1 30); do [ -f \"$S/ud/DevToolsActivePort\" ] && break; sleep 1; done; head -1 $S/ud/DevToolsActivePort > $S/port; else (cd /c/Users/chris/AppData/Local/Temp/agents/liquid-glass-run && bun reload.ts $(cat $S/port)); fi; (cd /c/Users/chris/AppData/Local/Temp/agents/liquid-glass-run && timeout 60 bun prep.ts $(cat $S/port) closed 420 $OUT/layers-$L.png >/dev/null); done; cp /tmp/LEF.tsx src/components/LibraryEdgeFade.tsx; git status --short; ls $OUT | grep layers","description":"Capture identical screenshots at 5 and 8 layers","timeout":500000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
