{"parentUuid":"d14fe4d7-fa9e-4219-ae8d-8829ffae1233","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFUxMY6Ch3GBd64pQV6b","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The \"Peek\" preset sets hoverIntensity to 0, which makes the blur vanish when hovering over the band - that's the reveal-on-hover effect, since hoverIntensity !== 1 enables pointer tracking that zeroes out the blur variable on hover. I also note our root element has pointer-events disabled.\n\nI should capture comparison screenshots: current Subtle-5 state versus Peek at the same scroll position, plus a hover screenshot showing the unblur effect. I'll keep the file changes uncommitted until they decide, and I need to rebuild with the current Subtle-5 settings first since the last build used a different layer count.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2179,"cache_read_input_tokens":183096,"output_tokens":1886,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":355},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2179,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1886,"cache_read_input_tokens":183096,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2179,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2179},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":5913,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFUxEhasKmxZyTjk1DVv","requestRef":"0d4697f0-344a-404a-83b8-ba49bd873174","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"50bfce85-a647-4e0a-8e70-46b09d074b3f","timestamp":"2026-10-21T13:44:54.234Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","eff