{"parentUuid":"ef175320-ca54-47ce-a2e0-17b18ba44995","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01QAVuTAbKcm1oA53yUrPAQm","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"d09f8e84-fd42-49f2-847d-34ee07bb7845","timestamp":"2026-10-21T13:46:37.473Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"d09f8e84-fd42-49f2-847d-34ee07bb7845","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFV64hYN6fBSmTVvdJNk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here are the current Subtle settings next to Peek, at the same scroll position and enlarged 1.5×.\n\n**Bottom edge**\n\nSubtle (current):\n![Subtle bottom](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\sidebar-overlap\\cmp-subtle-bottom.png)\n\nPeek:\n![Peek bottom](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\sidebar-overlap\\cmp-peek-bottom.png)\n\nPeek with the pointer over the bottom edge:\n![Peek hover](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\sidebar-overlap\\cmp-peek-hover-bottom.png)\n\n**Top edge**\n\nSubtle:\n![Subtle top](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\sidebar-overlap\\cmp-subtle-top.png)\n\nPeek:\n![Peek top](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\sidebar-overlap\\cmp-peek-top.png)\n\n- **Look:** Peek blurs about twice as deep (6rem tall instead of 4rem) and harder, so the edges dissolve more. Its tint is half as strong, so they look slightly less dark.\n- **Hover:** with a hover intensity of 0, the blur disappears entirely when the pointer is over a band, and the hard cutoff comes back (third image). At the top, that band is the toolbar strip, so the top blur would vanish whenever you reach for the search pill, Add, or back/forward.\n- **Speed:** scrolling dropped 1, 0 and 0 frames over three runs, about the same as the current setting.\n\nI've put the code back to the committed Subtle settings, so nothing changed.\n\nIf you like the Peek look, I'd take it but keep the hover intensity at 1, so the blur stays put."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":548,"cache_read_input_tokens":192185,"output_tokens":654,"output_tokens_details":{"thinki