{"parentUuid":"11b0af1b-f153-45f1-98fd-d724057058df","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFXjA7F1emv79WTbrQzp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I switched both edges to the Peek settings with strength 1 and pushed it to #170 as `060e351`:\n\n- **Size:** the bands are 6rem tall, with 5 layers.\n- **Feel:** ease-in curve, with exponential on. Saturation and opacity are 1, and auto hide is off.\n- **Tint:** `#120f17` at 15%.\n- **Hover:** hover intensity is 0, as you set it. The blur clears while the pointer is over an edge, including the toolbar strip at the top.\n\nAt strength 1 the blur is about as strong as the current Subtle setting, just spread over a taller band. I haven't opened the app to look at this exact combination; the screenshots I showed you were at strength 1.5.\n\n#174 is still untouched."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":221,"cache_read_input_tokens":198581,"output_tokens":251,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":221,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":251,"cache_read_input_tokens":198581,"cache_creation_input_tokens":221,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":221},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFXj9hCbn7r5v9oToUbP","requestRef":"3e0351bb-5af2-49de-b0ea-e09aa520246d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"990a8d24-a20f-483a-a5e9-195f84d2e14d","timestamp":"2026-10-21T14:21:11.585Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userT