{"parentUuid":"48ac7787-958d-4c83-887d-1ff71878ce4e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a3517b34-cc8c-4b62-a00d-702b9173dc92","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Kt8YBjGFyumrLviBjdeXNf","type":"tool_result","content":"27:## Unreleased\n29:### Added\n72:### Fixed\n79:### Changed\n113:### Removed\n120:### Fixed\n157:## Phase 5 -- Reading and Writing (Aug 25, 2026)\n159:### Added\n167:## Phase 4 -- PDF, Embeddings, CI (Aug 17-18, 2026)\n171:### Added\n182:### Fixed\n191:## Phase 3 -- Background OCR (Aug 15, 2026)\n\n- Library list IPC sends card fields only; reader content is loaded from SQLite when opened.\n- Library cards load remote images in CORS mode and the desktop app adds a CORS header to image responses, so the liquid glass canvas can draw them; no extra requests are made (#170)\n- Electron defers canvas system-font loading until PDF work runs; BMP and ICO thumbnails use canvas without loading system fonts.\n- Library cards form a denser masonry grid with tighter gutters and natural media proportions; note and quote previews stay readable, while list, Archive, and Serendipity views keep their existing geometry.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ad088db2-ee33-4d6d-87cc-92677c528b49","timestamp":"2026-10-21T15:06:46.682Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"27:## Unreleased\n29:### Added\n72:### Fixed\n79:### Changed\n113:### Removed\n120:### Fixed\n157:## Phase 5 -- Reading and Writing (Aug 25, 2026)\n159:### Added\n167:## Phase 4 -- PDF, Embeddings, CI (Aug 17-18, 2026)\n171:### Added\n182:### Fixed\n191:## Phase 3 -- Background OCR (Aug 15, 2026)\n\n- Library list IPC sends card fields only; reader content is loaded from SQLite when opened.\n- Library cards load remote images in CORS mode and the desktop app adds a CORS header to image responses, so the liquid glass canvas can draw them; no extra requests are made (#170)\n- Electron defers canvas system-font loading until PDF work runs; BMP and ICO thumbnails use canvas without loading system fonts.\n- Library cards form a denser masonry grid with tighter gutters and natural media proportions; note and quote previews stay readable, while list, Archive, and Serendipity views keep their existing geometry.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"48ac7787-958d-4c83-887d-1ff71878ce4e","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
