pp adds a CORS header to image responses, so the liquid glass canvas can draw them; no extra requests are made (#170)\n","new_string":"- Library cards load remote images in CORS mode and the desktop app adds a CORS header to image responses, so the liquid glass canvas can draw them; no extra requests are made (#170)\n- Switching between grid and list fades the cards out and pops the new view in, list rows top to bottom and grid cards from the top left, instead of morphing each card between layouts (#170)\n"}},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFbDCtZaCZqoLgy2K8XS","requestRef":"1ed206dd-3856-4aa8-b2b5-8e562f3f54c1","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"8d196ac4-6c07-49d4-95c3-483dee2f3595","timestamp":"2026-10-21T15:06:52.326Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"8d196ac4-6c07-49d4-95c3-483dee2f3595","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a3517b34-cc8c-4b62-a00d-702b9173dc92","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QCWAP6dCUSJK8fpqM57hEj","type":"tool_result","content":"The file C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304\\docs\\changelog.md has been updated successfully."}]},"uuid":"21e7b594-360d-4d5c-b62e-b9f299627009","timestamp":"2026-10-21T15:06:52.488Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304\\docs\\changelog.md","oldString":"- Library cards load remote images in CORS mode and the desktop app adds a CORS header to image responses, so the liquid glass canvas can draw them; no extra requests are made (#170)\n","newString":"- Library cards load remote images in CORS mode and the desktop app adds a CORS header to image responses, so the liquid glass canvas can draw them; no extra requests are made (#170)\n- Switching between grid and list fades the cards out and pops the new view in, list rows top to bottom and grid cards from the top left, instead of morphing each card between layouts (#170)\n","originalFile":null,"structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":80,"oldLines":6,"newStart":80,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," - Library list IPC sends card fields only; reader content is loaded from SQLite when opened."," - Library cards load remote images in CORS mode and the desktop app adds a CORS header to image responses, so the liquid glass canvas can draw them; no extra requests are made (#170)","+- Switching between grid and list fades the cards out and pops the new view in, list rows top to bottom and grid cards from the top left, instead of morphing each card between layouts (#170)"," - Electron defers canvas system-font loading until PDF work runs; BMP and ICO thumbnails use canvas without loading system fonts."," - Library cards form a denser masonry grid with tighter gutters and natural media proportions; note and quote previews stay readable, while list, Archive, and Serendipity views keep their existing geometry."," - Desktop window opens at 960 × 540 instead of 1000 × 800; the 320 × 360 minimum size is unchanged."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8d196ac4-6c07-49d4-95c3-483dee2f3595","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
