{"parentUuid":"cef59f71-55d2-4991-97c3-d5528ad81212","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01GyRcXkoVqFjkSPcLbwJ6np","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"5ba983b3-c6e1-4443-8198-c243aae75f10","timestamp":"2026-10-21T15:07:13.298Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"5ba983b3-c6e1-4443-8198-c243aae75f10","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFbEaHCeyksb7LLA4k5A","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The morph is gone, and switching views now fades out and pops back in as you described. It's pushed to #170 as `e015757`.\n\n**Grid → list** (frames from the start of the switch):\n![Grid to list](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\view-switch\\to-list-sheet.png)\n\n**List → grid:**\n![List to grid](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\view-switch\\to-grid-sheet.png)\n\n- **Fade out:** the current cards fade away over about 0.16 s.\n- **To list:** rows fade in with a slight drop from above, top row first.\n- **To grid:** cards fade in while scaling up slightly from 96%, starting at the top left and sweeping diagonally to the bottom right. The whole grid entrance takes about half a second.\n- **Off-screen cards:** only the ones in view animate. The rest stay hidden until the entrance finishes, so nothing flashes when you scroll during it.\n- **Toggle button:** the indicator moves as soon as you click, rather than waiting for the swap.\n- **Reduced motion:** with the system's reduce-motion setting on, the view just switches instantly.\n\nI checked it in the Electron preview, including clicking back mid-fade and mid-entrance. Every case ended with the right view showing and every card fully visible. Typecheck and Biome pass.\n\nThe old morph was about 550 lines of card cloning and layout measuring, and I removed all of it. I also added a changelog line and updated one selector in the grid benchmark script that pointed at the removed code."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":365,"cache_read_input_tokens":241069,"output_tokens":532,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":365,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":532,"cache_read_input_tokens":241069,"cache_creation_input_tokens":365,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":365},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFbEZkTfAJzony2C2fPc","requestRef":"814fb27e-dba3-41c7-b105-bc5a1e8bf2bd","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5b5ac606-74af-4595-8ca8-ddfceba7d640","timestamp":"2026-10-21T15:07:13.297Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
