{"parentUuid":"89243086-b986-48e5-a735-565c93c83766","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFeAK4QQi1pp1L7d84pp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm planning an HTML page with a reusable mockup function, where each window shows a sidebar, frame, and masonry image columns via CSS, with images loaded through JS path strings. I'm sketching out different toolbar arrangement variants, starting with the current floating-pills design versus a single centered glass capsule bar.\n\nI'm also outlining additional variants—moving controls into the titlebar chrome, a bottom-docked capsule, and integrating controls into the sidebar—while locking in the app's color palette and deciding on a fixed 680-728px mock width that scales proportionally.\n\nSimpler plan: design at a fixed 700px width with max-width 100%, and use a JS scale wrapper that computes scale from container width to apply via transform. I'll also need simple inline SVG icons for chevrons, grid, list, plus, and search.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1306,"cache_read_input_tokens":245628,"output_tokens":891,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":680},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1306,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":891,"cache_read_input_tokens":245628,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1306,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1306},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":12120,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFeAJhpw1TLsrhe2yszR","requestRef":"8