{"parentUuid":"8ca63fe6-ae75-48d7-928c-40fd5b0cfb0e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFffQ4DKUPFfxgxxyxAK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I notice option 2 would conflict with the collapse button's position, so I should flag that in my reply.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4821,"cache_read_input_tokens":90013,"output_tokens":418,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":33},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4821,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":418,"cache_read_input_tokens":90013,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4821,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4821},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":4655,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFffPfejg9rV5DEpeZKe","requestRef":"f572972b-0ae2-41d2-ae42-fa8b67980533","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"t3-code","attributionMcpTool":"html_render","type":"assistant","uuid":"9b8c047d-9dcc-41eb-b2fc-5ed3b39e6edb","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:05:17.463Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"9b8c047d-9dcc-41eb-b2fc-5ed3b39e6edb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFffQ4DKUPFfxgxxyxAK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Back/forward:** I think the visible buttons can go, but I'd keep the history behind them. It does two things the rest of the app doesn't:\n\n- It walks you back through a chain of \"Similar\" items you've opened one after another.\n- It takes you back to a search you had before you clicked into a Space.\n\nThe mouse side buttons and Alt+←/→ already drive it (`src/App.tsx:4088`), so removing just the two buttons keeps that behaviour and costs no space. In Serendipity the buttons are already hidden.\n\n**Which mockup:** I'd pick **1**. It leaves the brand row and the nav list alone, and Add stays a clear, labelled button.\n\n- Option 2 needs a spot right where the sidebar's collapse button sits now, so one of them would have to move.\n- Option 3 is tidy, but it puts an action in a list where every other row is a place you go.\n\n**When the sidebar is collapsed,** Add has no home. Paste and drag-in still work. I'd put a small + next to the \"Open navigation\" button that already appears top-left of the library in that state.\n\nTell me which one, and whether the + by the collapsed sidebar works for you, and I'll build it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4821,"cache_read_input_tokens":90013,"output_tokens":418,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":33},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4821,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":418,"cache_read_input_tokens":90013,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4821,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4821},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgFffPfejg9rV5DEpeZKe","requestRef":"f572972b-0ae2-41d2-ae42-fa8b67980533","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"t3-code","attributionMcpTool":"html_render","type":"assistant","uuid":"2366e6f9-186b-4e5e-a355-d7cb47304096","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:05:17.470Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
