{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","hash":"ae3f4e860eb06c069b0f0ba37474d8f787701e3d28ffed5937d24ab0e5f8b9f0","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm planning to remove the roam-related files entirely — roam.ts, roamStore, roamSpace, drift, RoamBoard, and MascotRoamLayer along with their tests — and relocate MASCOT_SIZE into MascotHomeSlot since that's its only remaining user, while double-checking whether faceMargin.test.ts still references roam.\n\nNext I need to trace through usages: MascotHomeSlot should drop useRoam and always render LiveMascotFigure, mascotStore should lose roamParams/pushRoamParams and possibly its clock subscription if nothing else needs it, and App.tsx needs its RoamBoard imports and roam effects stripped out, though I want to check whether failCapture and captureFailures are used elsewhere before simplifying them. I also need to clean up the CSS classes tied to roam and the mascot-home-empty state, plus check the changelog and roadmap docs to see if the roam feature entry sits under an unreleased section that should just be removed.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BNzdFuit9YTmZ3VEUpD3m8","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/t3-47ff5304 && grep -n \"^## \\|^### \" docs/changelog.md | head -12; grep -n -i \"roam\\|wander\" docs/roadmap.md docs/*.md src/components/mascot/faceMargin.test.ts src/components/mascot/bot/README.md; grep -rn \"failCapture\\|captureFailures\" src/App.tsx | wc -l; grep -rn \"setLook\\|subscribeClock\\|onEngineFrame\\|pushRoamParams\\|export function\\|export const\" src/components/mascot/mascotStore.tsx; grep -rn \"setLook\" src --include=*.ts* | grep -v \"bot/engine.ts\"","description":"Check docs and store dependencies"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
