{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","hash":"a3b16efe3426305e6f25eeaf23a0c64a8ea938f593a50743f6f01863e09522fb","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I should add a changelog entry under Changed describing the toolbar rework: moves consolidated into the sidebar foot, the grid/list toggle floating at bottom centre, removal of the back/forward buttons, while noting mouse side buttons and Alt+←/→ still navigate history (#170). Since mascot roaming was never released, no Removed line is needed.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Roaming is gone. Next I'm adding the changelog line and running the checks."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WKfJaC5Xroi3NbnwsjCnQ2","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/t3-47ff5304 && python - <<'EOF'\np=\"docs/changelog.md\"\ns=open(p,encoding=\"utf-8\",newline=\"\").read()\nanchor=\"instead of morphing each card between layouts (#170)\\n\"\nassert s.count(anchor)==1\ns=s.replace(anchor,anchor+\"- Add moves to the foot of the sidebar, with a round + in the toolbar while the sidebar is closed, and the grid/list toggle floats at the bottom centre of the library. The back and forward buttons are gone; the mouse side buttons and Alt+Left/Right still step through history (#170)\\n\")\nopen(p,\"w\",encoding=\"utf-8\",newline=\"\").write(s)\nEOF\nbunx biome check --write src/App.tsx src/App.css src/components/mascot/mascotStore.tsx src/components/mascot/MascotHomeSlot.tsx 2>&1 | tail -20; timeout 300 bunx tsc-rs --noEmit 2>&1 | head; bun test src/components/mascot src/components/liquidGlassShape.test.ts 2>&1 | tail -4; bunx knip 2>&1 | tail -15","description":"Changelog, lint, typecheck, tests, knip","timeout":400000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
