{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","prNumber":170,"prUrl":"https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/170","prRepository":"Squidys-Tools/inkling","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:13:32.797Z"}
{"parentUuid":"379a88e3-4718-4f1c-a324-1cb970a4dad1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFgJKyvcPweM2MRawFuQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm tracing through the dock's liquid glass rendering positions, trying to figure out why the glass shape is appearing at the wrong y-coordinate — it seems like the second band's container offset isn't being honored correctly, causing a mismatch between the expected dock position and where it's actually drawn.\n\nLooking more closely, I suspect the second band is reusing the first band's transform instead of its own container.y, which suggests the sync() call snapshots the layer transforms before my positional update takes effect. I need to check whether calling sync() again per band would fix this without being too expensive, or whether there's a better approach to how the container offsets get applied.\n\nChecking the edge tab overlap in the closed screenshot — positions look fine, no actual collision there. I need to dig into what sync() actually does with container.y to understand the root cause.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2662,"cache_read_input_tokens":177903,"output_tokens":887,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":648},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2662,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":887,"cache_read_input_tokens":177903,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2662,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2662},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":13711,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized",