{"parentUuid":"61c7d983-6c44-41a2-880e-3e59f2c153bb","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01DEyroAaAZAFnx3JagyUop6","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"59fdbbcc-40ac-4fbc-9574-6cf887b8465c","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:30:34.094Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"59fdbbcc-40ac-4fbc-9574-6cf887b8465c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFhb5c5JAyiDQjvHEJnM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The back/forward buttons and the mascot roaming are both gone. Add is now at the foot of the sidebar and the grid/list toggle sits at the bottom centre. Both are pushed to #170 as `6d47b2a`; #174 is untouched.\n\n![Sidebar open, Add at the foot, toggle at the bottom](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\toolbar\\open.png)\n\n![Sidebar closed, round + top left](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\toolbar\\closed.png)\n\n**Toolbar**\n- **Back/forward:** only the buttons are removed. The mouse side buttons and Alt+←/→ still move through history.\n- **Add:** a bigger full-width button, 40px tall with 12px corners, a slight raised highlight and a soft shadow. It sits in the sidebar above Settings.\n- **Sidebar closed:** a round + appears top-left in the library, so Add is never out of reach.\n- **Grid/list toggle:** floats at the bottom centre over the bottom blur. The search pill hasn't changed.\n\n**One change you didn't ask for:** the liquid glass renderer used to redraw only one strip across the top of the window. Putting glass at the bottom would have made it redraw the whole frame on every scroll. It now redraws one strip at the top and one at the bottom. Scrolling and the sidebar slide measured within the same noisy range as before.\n\n**Mascot roaming:** everything for it is deleted: the wandering, the steering around cards, the overlay it walked on, its dev page at `?mascot-roam`, and its tests. The mascot now always stays in its sidebar spot, still drifting gently and moving into the search field when you focus it. Roaming hadn't been released, so I removed its changelog entry and roadmap line rather than writing a \"Removed\" note.\n\n**Checks:** typecheck, Biome, knip and the mascot and glass tests all pass. In the Electron preview I clicked the list toggle (it switched) and Add (the capture window opened)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":389,"cache_read_input_tokens":192928,"output_tokens":692,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":389,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":692,"cache_read_input_tokens":192928,"cache_creation_input_tokens":389,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":389},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFhb5HU2Jt4pobN734go","requestRef":"9c9a6b13-c381-4f55-917c-387834cd1e97","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a2559b74-5736-499f-b07b-3760ab39bee4","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:30:34.094Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
