{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:54:22.605Z","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","content":"I want to try out some different styling for things without having to get rid of anything yet, make an appearance tab in settings so components cant be switched between options, that way I can expirement with combining a bunch of different component and styles and later on we can just delete all the ones I decide not to keep. the first toggle I want in that settings tab will be for the grid/list toggle, and the new component I want to try out is segmented control from coss.com ui you can get from col. of course custom styled and using the liquid glass with css glass fallback"}
