{"parentUuid":"4a38f522-256b-4dd6-932d-b62a10daa3ef","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[{"name":"mcp__col__get_component","description":"One component's canonical documentation link, the npm dependencies and registry components the library records for it, and verified compatibility facts (explicit \"unknown\" where nothing is verified). Col publishes no install commands: read the library's setup docs for those. Ids come from search_components as '<library-slug>/<component name>'. Col's component coverage is partial: a missing component means 'not yet verified', never 'this library does not have it'. Never infer a component from a library's generic tags. Results link to their canonical sources and mark what is unverified. This server is read-only and never requests or stores credentials.","input_schema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"description":"Component id from search_components, e.g. 'shadcn-ui/Command'."}},"required":["id"]},"eager_input_streaming":true,"defer_loading":true},{"name":"mcp__col__get_library","description":"Discover one library: description, stacks, the official docs and site to set it up from, pricing, the components Col records for it (with componentCount), verified compatibility facts (explicit \"unknown\" where nothing is verified), and permitted documentation snapshots. Col publishes no install commands: read the current official docs before installing. Libraries marked outboundOnly omit setup links and snapshots. Col's component coverage is partial: a missing component means 'not yet verified', never 'this library does not have it'. Never infer a component from a library's generic tags. Results link to their canonical sources and mark what is unverified. This server is read-only and never requests or stores credentials.","input_schema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"slug":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"description":"Library slug from search_libraries, e.g. 'shadcn-ui'."}},"required":["slug"]},"eager_input_streaming":true,"defer_loading":true},{"name":"mcp__col__search_components","description":"Find components by their official name or a real alias, optionally scoped to one library and one or more stacks. Every hit links to the component's own documentation page on the library's domain, states what matched, and names its kind. Col's component coverage is partial: a missing component means 'not yet verified', never 'this library does not have it'. Never infer a component from a library's generic tags. Results link to their canonical sources and mark what is unverified. This server is read-only and never requests or stores credentials.","input_schema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"description":"Component name or alias, e.g. 'command palette' or 'datepicker'."},"library":{"description":"Restrict to one library slug.","type":"string","minLength":1},"stacks":{"description":"Every listed stack must apply (AND). At most one framework.","type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["React","Next.js","Vue","Svelte","SvelteKit","Angular","SolidJS","Astro","Vanilla JS","Tailwind CSS","TypeScript"]}},"limit":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":25},"offset":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991}},"required":["query"]},"eager_input_streaming":true,"defer_loading":true},{"name":"mcp__col__search_libraries","description":"Find UI libraries that fit a project's framework, styling approach, and use case. Returns stable library slugs, official source links, the components that explain each match, and explicit gaps. Col's component coverage is partial: a missing component means 'not yet verified', never 'this library does not have it'. Never infer a component from a library's generic tags. Results link to their canonical sources and mark what is unverified. This server is read-only and never requests or stores credentials.","input_schema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"query":{"description":"What to find, e.g. 'accessible command menu'. Keywords match library names, descriptions, tags, and verified component names and aliases.","type":"string"},"category":{"description":"Exact category filter.","anyOf":[{"type":"string","enum":["Component Library","Animation & Motion","Templates & Blocks","Icons","Charts & Data Viz","3D & WebGL","CSS Framework","Design Inspiration"]},{"type":"null"}]},"stacks":{"description":"Every listed stack must apply (AND). At most one framework.","type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["React","Next.js","Vue","Svelte","SvelteKit","Angular","SolidJS","Astro","Vanilla JS","Tailwind CSS","TypeScript"]}},"useCases":{"description":"At least one listed use case must apply.","type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["Landing Pages","Dashboards","Micro-interactions","Marketing Sites","Data Visualization","Accessibility-first","Rapid Prototyping","Creative & Experimental"]}},"limit":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":25},"offset":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991}}},"eager_input_streaming":true,"defer_loading":true}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"be8f598f-e086-40e6-bbe4-9484e9f8b442","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:54:30.732Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
